</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">}</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_6i5l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_3k6i5l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h3 id="generate-certificate-and-key-with-external-policy" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="generate certificate and key with external policy permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#generate-certificate-and-key-with-external-policy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Generate certificate and key with external policy <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_b86m5l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h3><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Similar to the <a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#generate-certificate-and-key">generate certificate and key</a>
endpoint, this endpoint generate key material and certificate via an external
policy engine. The private key material stays local to Vault, with the external
service getting only an empty CSR. Any parameters passed to this endpoint are
passed verbatim to the Certificate Issuance External
Policy Service (CIEPS)<span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_5g6q5l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span>. The
response format is the same between both endpoints.</p><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">It is suggested to limit access to the path-overridden issue endpoint (on
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">/pki/issuer/:issuer_ref/external-policy/issue/:policy</code>) and let the CIEPS
engine override the issuer as necessary.</p><div class="mdx-table_root__adKqa mdx-content-full-width"><div class="mdx-table_tableWrapper__81O9J"><table><thead><tr><th align="left">Method</th><th align="left">Path</th><th align="left">Issuer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">POST</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/external-policy/issue(/:policy)</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">default</code> or CIEPS-selected</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">POST</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/issuer/:issuer_ref/external-policy/issue(/:policy)</code></td><td align="left">Path or CIEPS selected</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mdx-table_tableFocusRing__qNrYf"></div><div><div class="mdx-table_leftScrim__mYsmq mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div><div class="mdx-table_rightScrim__Ikt63 mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div></div></div><h4 id="parameters-2" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="parameters permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#parameters-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Parameters</h4><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="policy" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="policy permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#policy"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">policy</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;optional&gt;)</code> - Specifies the name of the policy to create
the certificate against. This is part of the request URL and is passed to the
external CIEPS engine.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="issuer_ref-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="issuer_ref permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#issuer_ref-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">issuer_ref</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;required&gt;)</code> - Reference to an existing issuer,
either by Vault-generated identifier, the literal string <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">default</code> to
refer to the currently configured default issuer, or the name assigned
to an issuer. This parameter is part of the request URL.</p></li></ul><div class="alert alert-warning g-type-body"><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Note: This parameter is not present on the <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">/pki/external-policy/sign/:policy</code>
path and takes its value from the CIEPS engine response&#x27;s <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">issuer_ref</code>
field, which can override the user-requested issuer.</p></div><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="format-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="format permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#format-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">format</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;pem&quot;)</code> - Specifies the format for returned data. Can be:</p><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pem-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><a aria-label="pem permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pem-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pem</code></a> - Base64 encoded text data.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="der-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><a aria-label="der permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#der-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">der</code></a> - Base64 encoded binary data.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pem_bundle-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><a aria-label="pem_bundle permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pem_bundle-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pem_bundle</code></a> - Private key and certificate concatenated in the <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">certificate</code>
field, along with the issuing CA if it is not a Vault-derived, self-signed
root.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pkcs12_bundle-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><a aria-label="pkcs12_bundle permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pkcs12_bundle-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_bundle</code></a> - Base64 encoded with the private key, certificate, and CA
chain in the PKCS#12 archive.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="jks_bundle-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><a aria-label="jks_bundle permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#jks_bundle-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_bundle</code></a> - Provided for compatibility with legacy systems. Avoid in
favor of <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_bundle</code> whenever possible. Base64 encoded with the private
key, certificate, and CA chain in the Java keystore (JKS).</li></ul></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="key_type" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="key_type permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#key_type"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;rsa&quot;)</code> - Specifies the desired key type; must be <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">rsa</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ed25519</code>,
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ec</code>, or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ml-dsa</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="key_bits" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="key_bits permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#key_bits"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_bits</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(int: 0)</code> - Specifies the number of bits to use for the
generated keys. Allowed values are 0 (universal default); with
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type=rsa</code>, allowed values are: 2048 (default), 3072, 4096 or 8192;
with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type=ec</code>, allowed values are: 224, 256 (default),
384, or 521; ignored with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type=ed25519</code> or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type=ml-dsa</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="parameter_set" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="parameter_set permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#parameter_set"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">parameter_set</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;ml-dsa-44&quot;)</code> - For ML-DSA keys, specifies the parameter set for it;
must be <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;ml-dsa-44&quot;</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;ml-dsa-65&quot;</code>, or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;ml-dsa-87&quot;</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="private_key_format-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="private_key_format permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#private_key_format-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">private_key_format</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;der&quot;)</code> - Specifies the format for marshaling
the private key within the private_key response field. Defaults to <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">der</code> which will
return either base64-encoded DER or PEM-encoded DER, depending on the value of
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">format</code> (<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">private_key</code> is not returned as a separate field when format
is <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_bundle</code> or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_bundle</code>). The other option is <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs8</code> which will return the
key marshalled as PEM-encoded PKCS8.</p></li></ul><div class="alert alert-warning g-type-body"><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><strong>Note</strong> that this does not apply to the private key within the certificate
field if <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">format</code> is specified as either <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;pem_bundle&quot;</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;pkcs12_bundle&quot;</code> or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;jks_bundle&quot;</code>.</p></div><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pkcs12_encoder-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="pkcs12_encoder permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pkcs12_encoder-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_encoder</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;modern2026&quot;)</code> - Encoder profile to use for PKCS#12
archives when format is set to <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_bundle</code>. Valid values are <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">modern2026</code> and
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">modern2023</code>. The <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">modern2026</code> profile uses the newer PKCS#12 integrity algorithm, PBMAC1.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pkcs12_password-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="pkcs12_password permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pkcs12_password-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_password</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;changeit&quot;)</code> - Password for encrypting the PKCS#12
archive when format is set to <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pkcs12_bundle</code>. We recommend using a high-entropy
password or using the default password and protecting the file using other means. </p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="jks_password-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="jks_password permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#jks_password-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_password</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;changeit&quot;)</code> - Password for encrypting the Java keystore
when format is set to <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_bundle</code>. We recommend using a high-entropy
password or using the default password and protecting the file using other means. </p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="jks_private_key_alias-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="jks_private_key_alias permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#jks_private_key_alias-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_private_key_alias</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;1&quot;)</code> - The entry alias in the Java keystore (JKS) when
format is set to <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_bundle</code> and bundle contains a single <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">PrivateKeyEntry</code>.
The <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_private_key_alias</code> field is case-sensitive, but you should avoid using
case-only differences to determine between unique aliases. Endpoints that
return <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">TrustedCertificateEntry</code> values (trust stores) ignore <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">jks_private_key_alias</code>
in favor of assigning incrementing numeric string aliases starting at <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">&quot;1&quot;</code>. </p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="remove_roots_from_chain-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="remove_roots_from_chain permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#remove_roots_from_chain-1"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">remove_roots_from_chain</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(bool: false)</code> - If true, the returned <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ca_chain</code>
field will not include any self-signed CA certificates. Useful if end-users
already have the root CA in their trust store.</p></li></ul><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Other parameters may be specified and will not be parsed by Vault but may be
recognized based on external CIEPS engine definition.</p><h4 id="sample-payload-1" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample payload permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-payload-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample payload</h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_865l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
