</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;issuing_ca&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nMIIDUTCCAjmgAwIBAgIJAKM+z4MSfw2mMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBCwUAMBsxGTAXBgNV\n...\nG/7g4koczXLoUM3OQXd5Aq2cs4SS1vODrYmgbioFsQ3eDHd1fg==\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----\n&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
