or" id="_R_b9925l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h3><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">This endpoint returns a list of stored certificate metadata. Only the
serial numbers of the certificates the metadata is associated with are
returned, not the certificate metadata itself.</p><div class="mdx-table_root__adKqa mdx-content-full-width"><div class="mdx-table_tableWrapper__81O9J"><table><thead><tr><th align="left">Method</th><th align="left">Path</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">LIST</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/cert-metadata</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mdx-table_tableFocusRing__qNrYf"></div><div><div class="mdx-table_leftScrim__mYsmq mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div><div class="mdx-table_rightScrim__Ikt63 mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div></div></div><h4 id="sample-request-20" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample request permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-request-20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample request</h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WL