</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --data &quot;@payload.json&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    http://127.0.0.1:8200/v1/pki/config/ca</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_1ku5l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_3lku5l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Note that if you provide the data through the HTTP API, it must be
JSON-formatted, with newlines replaced with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">\n</code>, like so:</p><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_1l65l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">  &quot;pem_bundle&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----&quot;</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">}</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_1l65l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_3ll65l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h4 id="sample-response-27" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample response permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-response-27"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample response</h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_1le5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">  &quot;data&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> {</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;imported_issuers&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> [</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)">&quot;1ae8ce9d-2f70-0761-a465-8c9840a247a2&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">]</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;imported_keys&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> [</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)">&quot;97be2525-717a-e2f7-88da-0a20e11aad88&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">]</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
