default is cleared if this issuer is the default issuer.</p><div class="alert alert-warning g-type-body"><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><strong>Note</strong>: If an issuer is incorrectly deleted, but its key material
remains, it is possible to re-import just the issuer certificate. The
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">issuer_id</code> will change, but the name can be re-assigned to the new
issuer.</p></div><div class="mdx-table_root__adKqa mdx-content-full-width"><div class="mdx-table_tableWrapper__81O9J"><table><thead><tr><th align="left">Method</th><th align="left">Path</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">DELETE</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/issuer/:issuer_ref</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mdx-table_tableFocusRing__qNrYf"></div><div><div class="mdx-table_leftScrim__mYsmq mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div><div class="mdx-table_rightScrim__Ikt63 mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div></div></div><h4 id="sample-request-29" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample request permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-request-29"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample request</h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-shellsession mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_1s25l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-cyan)">$</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> curl \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Token: ...&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --request DELETE \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    http://127.0.0.1:8200/v1/pki/issuer/root-x1</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_1s25l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_3ls25l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h3 id="export-key-management" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="export key management permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export-key-management"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Export key management <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_b9s65l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h3><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">The following endpoints manage the asymmetric keypairs used to wrap CA private
keys during secure export. The public half of an export keypair is supplied to
<a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export-ca-key">Export CA key</a> on the source mount. The corresponding private
half, held by the destination mount, is used to unwrap the blob during
<a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#import-key">Import key</a>.</p><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Export keys are per-mount and stored sealed in Vault&#x27;s barrier storage. The
private half is never returned by any API endpoint.</p><h4 id="create-export-key" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="create export key permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#create-export-key"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Create export key <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_b9si5l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h4><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">This endpoint generates a new asymmetric keypair for use as a wrapping key
during CA key export. Vault stores the private half internally and returns the
public half to the caller.</p><div class="mdx-table_root__adKqa mdx-content-full-width"><div class="mdx-table_tableWrapper__81O9J"><table><thead><tr><th align="left">Method</th><th align="left">Path</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">POST</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/export</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mdx-table_tableFocusRing__qNrYf"></div><div><div class="mdx-table_leftScrim__mYsmq mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div><div class="mdx-table_rightScrim__Ikt63 mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div></div></div><h5 id="parameters-24" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h5__d2ufM"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="parameters permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#parameters-24"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Parameters</h5><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="key_type-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="key_type permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#key_type-4"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_type</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;required&gt;)</code> - Algorithm for the keypair. Supported
values: <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">rsa-2048</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">rsa-3072</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">rsa-4096</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ec-p256</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ec-p384</code>,
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ec-p521</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ml-kem-768</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ml-kem-1024</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="name-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="name permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#name-4"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">name</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> - Optional human-readable name for this export key.
Must be unique across all export keys on this mount.</p></li></ul><h5 id="sample-payload-15" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h5__d2ufM"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample payload permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-payload-15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample payload</h5><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_1ta5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
