lass="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">  &quot;data&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> {</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;ca_key_uuid&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;2cf03991-b052-1dc3-393e-374b41f8dcd8&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;wrapped_key&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;eyJhbGciOiJSU0EtT0FFUC1TSEEyNTYrQUVTMjU2R0NNIiwid3JhcHBlZF9jZWsiOiIuLi4iLCJub25jZSI6Ii4uLiIsImNpcGhlcnRleHQiOiIuLi4ifQ==&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;export_key_hmac&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;sha256:e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">,</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-keyword)">    &quot;exported_at&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-punctuation)">:</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-string)"> &quot;2026-09-03T14:22:00Z&quot;</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">  }</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">}</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_22e5l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_3m2e5l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h3 id="import-key" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="import key permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#import-key"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Import key</h3><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">This endpoint allows an operator to import a single PEM-encoded <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">rsa</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ec</code>, <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ed25519</code>, or <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">ml-dsa</code>
key. On Vault Enterprise, the endpoint also accepts a wrapped key blob produced by
<a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export-ca-key">Export CA key</a> to support secure CA migration.</p><div class="mdx-inline-alert_spacing___QlMF"><div class="inline-alert_default___c6Mu hds-typography-body-200 inline-alert_warning__2yPdZ mdx-inline-alert_typographyOverride__DHnxV"><span class="inline-alert_icon__b_Ema" data-testid="icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11 17a1 1 0 011-1h.01a1 1 0 110 2H12a1 1 0 01-1-1zM12.75 8.75a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v4.5a.75.75 0 001.5 0v-4.5z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.658 2.366a2.651 2.651 0 012.684 0c.407.239.745.581.984.99l.002.004 8.315 14.46a2.86 2.86 0 01.008 2.758 2.757 2.757 0 01-.976 1.03c-.41.25-.877.386-1.357.392H3.682a2.653 2.653 0 01-1.357-.393 2.757 2.757 0 01-.975-1.029 2.86 2.86 0 01.007-2.758l.006-.01 8.31-14.45.001-.004a2.75 2.75 0 01.984-.99zm.313 1.744v.001L2.665 18.552a1.36 1.36 0 000 1.306c.108.198.262.36.443.47.18.11.382.169.586.172h16.61c.204-.003.406-.061.586-.172.181-.11.335-.272.444-.47a1.361 1.361 0 00-.001-1.306L13.03 4.112l-.001-.002a1.25 1.25 0 00-.446-.45 1.151 1.151 0 00-1.166 0 1.25 1.25 0 00-.446.45z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></g></svg></span><span class="inline-alert_content__fR9kv" style="overflow:hidden"><p class="inline-alert_title__20wIt">Note</p><span class="inline-alert_description__tisu9"><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">This API does not protect against importing keys using insecure combinations of
algorithm and key length. Exactly one of <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pem_bundle</code> or the <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">wrapped_key</code> +
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">export_key_hmac</code> pair must be provided.</p></span></span></div></div><div class="mdx-table_root__adKqa mdx-content-full-width"><div class="mdx-table_tableWrapper__81O9J"><table><thead><tr><th align="left">Method</th><th align="left">Path</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">POST</code></td><td align="left"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200 mdx-inline-code_tableCellSolelyInlineCode__rF5GI">/pki/keys/import</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mdx-table_tableFocusRing__qNrYf"></div><div><div class="mdx-table_leftScrim__mYsmq mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div><div class="mdx-table_rightScrim__Ikt63 mdx-table_scrim__VtktE"></div></div></div><h4 id="parameters-28" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="parameters permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#parameters-28"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Parameters</h4><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="pem_bundle-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="pem_bundle permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#pem_bundle-9"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pem_bundle</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> - Specifies the unencrypted private key in PEM format.
Mutually exclusive with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">wrapped_key</code> and <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">export_key_hmac</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="key_name-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="key_name permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#key_name-3"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">key_name</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> - Provides a name to the specified key. The
name must be unique across all keys and not be the reserved value
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">default</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="wrapped_key" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="wrapped_key permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#wrapped_key"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">wrapped_key</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_ame365l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span> - Base64-encoded wrapped
key blob returned by <a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export-ca-key">Export CA key</a>. Must be provided together with
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">export_key_hmac</code>. Mutually exclusive with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">pem_bundle</code>.</p></li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="export_key_hmac" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#"></a><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA"><a aria-label="export_key_hmac permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export_key_hmac"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">export_key_hmac</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_ami365l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span> - The HMAC fingerprint
returned by <a class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#export-ca-key">Export CA key</a>, used to identify which export key to use for
decryption. Must be provided together with <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">wrapped_key</code>.</p></li></ul><h4 id="sample-payload-pem-bundle" class="hds-typography-display-300 hds-font-weight-semibold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h4__v7716"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow" aria-label="sample payload pem bundle permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/pki#sample-payload-pem-bundle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample payload (PEM bundle)</h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_23e5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
