_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h4><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_23m5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">{</span></span>
