e__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">path</code>, which sets the URL to this mount on
a particular performance replication cluster. This is useful for populating
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">{{cluster_path}}</code> during AIA URL templating, but may be used for other
