ntName:\"li\"},`NotAfter`),` exceeds that of this issuer;`,mdx(\"ul\",{parentName:\"li\"},mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"strong\",{parentName:\"li\"},`Note`),` for CA issuance and ACME issuance this behavior is overridden\nwith truncate behavior, use `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"li\"},`always_enforce_err`),` to disable these overrides`))),mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"truncate\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#truncate\",\"aria-label\":\"truncate permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`truncate`)),` to silently truncate the requested `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"li\"},`NotAfter`),` value to that\nof this issuer; or`),mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"permit\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#permit\",\"aria-label\":\"permit permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`permit`)),` to allow this issuance to succeed with a `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"li\"},`NotAfter`),` value\nexceeding that of this issuer.`)))),mdx(\"div\",{className:\"alert alert-warning g-type-body\"},mdx(\"p\",null,`Note: Not all values result in leaf certificates that can be validated\nthrough the entire validity period. It is suggested to use `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`truncate`),` for\nintermediate CAs and `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`permit`),` only for root CAs. This is because\n(root) certificates in browsers' trust stores typically aren't checked\nfor validity, whereas intermediate CA certificates sent in TLS connections\nare checked for validity at the time of use. This means that a leaf\ncertificate permitted to be issued for longer than the intermediate likely\nwon't continue to validate after the intermediate has expired.`)),mdx(\"ul\",null,mdx(\"li