},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"p\",\"href\":\"#usage\",\"aria-label\":\"usage permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`usage`)),` `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`([]string: read-only,issuing-certificates,crl-signing,ocsp-signing)`),` - Allowed\nusages for this issuer. Valid options are:`),mdx(\"ul\",{parentName:\"li\"},mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"read-only\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#read-only\",\"aria-label\":\"read only permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`read-only`)),`, to allow this issuer to be read; implict; always allowed;`),mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"issuing-certificates-1\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#issuing-certificates-1\",\"aria-label\":\"issuing certificates permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`issuing-certificates`)),`, to allow this issuer to be used for issuing other\ncertificates; or`),mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"crl-signing\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#crl-signing\",\"aria-label\":\"crl signing permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`crl-signing`)),`, to allow this issuer to be used for signing CRLs. This is\nseparate from the CRLSign KeyUsage on the x509 certificate, but this usage\ncannot be set unless that KeyUsage is allowed on the x509 certificate.`),mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"ocsp-signing\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#ocsp-signing\",\"aria-label\":\"ocsp signing permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`ocsp-signing`)),`, to allow this issuer to be used for signing OCSP responses`)))),mdx(\"div\",{className:\"alert alert-warning g-type-body\"},mdx(\"p\",null,`Note: The `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`usage`),` field allows for a soft-delete capability on the issuer,\nor to prevent use of the issuer prior to it being enabled. For example,\nas issuance is rotated to a new issuer, the old issuer could be marked\n`,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`usage=read-only,crl-signing,ocsp-signing`),`, allowing existing certificates to be revoked\n(and the CRL updated), but preventing new certificate issuance. After all\ncertificates issued under this certificate have expired, this certificate\ncould be marked `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"p\"},`usage=read-only`),`, freezing the CRL. Finally, after a grace\nperiod, the issuer could be deleted.`)),mdx(\"ul\",null,mdx(\"li\",{parentName:\"ul\"},mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"id\":\"revocation_signature_algorithm\",\"className\":\"__target-lic\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}),mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"#revocation_signature_algorithm\",\"aria-label\":\"revocation_signature_algorithm permalink\",\"className\":\"__permalink-lic\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`revocation_signature_algorithm`)),` `,mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"li\"},`(string: \"\")`),` - Which signature algorithm\nto use when building CRLs. See Go's `,mdx(\"a\",{parentName:\"li\",\"href\":\"https://pkg.go.dev/crypto/x509#SignatureAlgorithm\"},mdx(\"inlineCode\",{parentName:\"a\"},`x509.SignatureAlgorithm`)),`\nconstant for possible values. This flag allows control over hash function\nand signature scheme (PKCS#1v1.5 vs PSS). The default (empty string) value\nis for Go to select the signature algorithm automatically, which may not\nalways work.`)),mdx(\"div\",{className:\"alert alert-warning g-type-body\"},mdx(\"p\",null,`Note: This can fail if the underlying key does not support the req